        <p>
          An alphabetical index of the principal named results, convergence criteria, compactness theorems, and differentiation or integration theorems used throughout the real analysis section.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="index-tools" aria-label="Theorems index controls">
        <label class="search-control">
          <span>Search theorems</span>
          <input
